{% extends "templates/base.tmpl" %}
{% block title %}Saddle Search Benchmark{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h2>Saddle Search Benchmark</h2>

<h3><a id="pt-heptamer" href="#pt-heptamer">Pt Heptamer Island</a></h3>

<p>This benchmark measure the effiency of finding saddles for a Pt heptamer island. The potential energy is given by a Morse potential:

\[ V(r) = D(e^{-2\alpha(r-r_0)} - 2 e^{-\alpha(r-r_0)}) \]

with $D=0.7102$, $\alpha=1.6047$, and $r_0=2.897$.</p>

<p>The goal of the benchmark is to deterimine how many force calls on average a saddle search method requires. Each saddle search is started from a displacement from the minimum. Each displacement should be made by adding a gaussian random number to each cartesian coordinate of the island atoms. The saddle search is considered complete when the maximum force on an atom is reduced to below $10^{-5}$ eV/Angstrom.</p>

<p>Entries to this benchmark should average over at least 100 saddle searches in order to have good statistics.</p>

<table class="sortable table table-striped table-condensed table-bordered table-hover benchmark-table">
  <thead>
    <th>Entry</th>
    <th>&rho;</th>
    <th>n<sub>s</sub></th>
    <th>N<sub>saddle</sub></th>
    <th>N<sub>relax</sub></th>
    <th>N<sub>total</sub></th>
  </thead>
  {% for entry in benchmarks['pt-heptamer-island']|sort(attribute='force_calls') %}
    <tr>
      <td>{% include 'templates/entry-details.tmpl' %}</td>
      <td>{{'%.2f' % entry.rho}}</td>
      <td>{{'%.0f' % entry.ns}}</td>
      <td>{{'%.0f' % entry.nsaddle}}</td>
      <td>{{'%.0f' % entry.nrelax}}</td>
      <td>{{'%.0f' % entry.ntotal}}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

{% endblock %}
